    "## Norm and Distance\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ac772aa6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### L1 Norm (Manhattan distance)\n",
    "\n",
    "`||x||_1 = |x_1| + ... + |x_2|`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "090c8b78",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### L2 Norm (Euclidean distance)\n",
    "\n",
    "`||x||_2 = sqrt(x_1^2 + ... + x_n^2)`"
   ]
  }
 ],
